# Third-party libraries Formbrod builds against.
#
# tools/fetch-deps.sh reads this file. Each dependency ends up in
# deps/<name>/include and deps/<name>/lib (static .a libraries only).
#
# Columns (whitespace-separated, one dependency per line):
#   name     directory name under deps/
#   url      archive to download (.lha/.lzh, .tar.*, .tgz or .zip)
#   sha256   expected checksum, or - to skip the check. The script prints
#            the checksum it sees, so pin it here once you trust a download.
#   header   a header that marks the include root, relative to it
#   lib      a static library that marks the lib directory
#
# The archive's own layout doesn't matter: the script searches it for
# `header` and `lib`, preferring newlib builds over clib2/clib4 ones.
#
# To add a dependency: add a line, run tools/fetch-deps.sh <name>, then add
# its -I/-L/-l flags to the Makefile (see the ffmpeg block there).

# ffmpeg 8.0 libraries for AmigaOS 4 by Michael Trebilcock (LGPL; OS4Depot
# lists it as "Distribute: no", so it's downloaded, never committed).
# Needs libz and libbz2 at link time.
ffmpeg  https://os4depot.net/share/development/misc/libffmpeg.lha  -  libavformat/avformat.h  libavformat.a
